        "text": "AD7606 / TWO EMG / TWO ICM-42688-P \u2014 COMPLETE SYSTEM CONTEXT"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "wokwi-text",
      "id": "legend",
      "left": -290,
      "top": -325,
      "attrs": {
        "text": "Green/orange: executed digital interfaces   Purple: analog chain illustration\nRed/black: ideal power context   Gray: SDMMC replaced by RAM disk   Blue: logical UDP link"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "wokwi-text",
      "id": "power_note",
      "left": 360,
      "top": -165,
      "attrs": {
        "text": "3.3 V digital \u00b7 3.0 V analog \u00b7 5 V ADC \u00b7 1.5 V midpoint\nBattery and USB states are injected by the fixture.\nPower, charging, USB transport and runtime are NOT simulated."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "wokwi-text",
      "id": "myo_note",
      "left": -320,
      "top": 440,
      "attrs": {
        "text": "EMG1 / EMG2\nNo electrodes or person.\n1 V / 2 V known inputs are\ngenerated inside ADC model.\nAnalog response: separate ngspice."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "wokwi-text",
      "id": "adc_note",
      "left": 15,
      "top": 350,
      "attrs": {
        "text": "AD7606 \u00b7 \u00b15 V \u00b7 OS=0\nCVA/CVB together \u00b7 all 8 words read\nOnly EMG1/2 exported. Mode straps\nand unused inputs: see lab guide."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "wokwi-text",
      "id": "foot_note",
      "left": 735,
      "top": 40,
      "attrs": {
        "text": "FOOT / ICM-42688-P / 200 Hz"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "wokwi-text",
      "id": "shank_note",
      "left": 735,
      "top": 215,
      "attrs": {
        "text": "SHANK / ICM-42688-P / 200 Hz"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "wokwi-text",
      "id": "controls_note",
      "left": 320,
      "top": 300,
      "attrs": {
        "text": "REC     ERROR     LOW\nStart/stop shown; automated\nfixture controls this short run."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "wokwi-text",
      "id": "storage_note",
      "left": 360,
      "top": 535,
      "attrs": {
        "text": "Real FatFS write / sync / reopen\nPSRAM medium substitutes SD card.\nSDMMC wires are context only."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "wokwi-text",
      "id": "wifi_note",
      "left": 760,
      "top": -160,
      "attrs": {
        "text": "No physical radio/laptop simulation.\nProduction UDP + internal subscriber;\nreal laptop replay tested separately."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "wokwi-text",
      "id": "esp_note",
      "left": 380,
      "top": -20,
      "attrs": {
        "text": "ESP32-S3 N8R8\nProduction ESP-IDF image + fixture\nUpload merged.bin with F1.\nOutputs: serial file + UDP exports."
